.. highlight:: none

.. _syn-tools-service-v3ready:

service.v3ready
===============

The Synapse ``service.v3ready`` tool checks or prepares a Synapse service for the upgrade to Synapse 3.x. It runs
the same check and preparation as the :ref:`storm-v3-checkready` and :ref:`storm-v3-prepare` Storm commands, for
one service, and exits with a non-zero status when the service is not ready. Run it against the leader of the
service.

Syntax
------

``service.v3ready`` is executed using ``python -m synapse.tools.service.v3ready``. The command usage is as follows:

.. shell:: --fail-ok python -m synapse.tools.service.v3ready -h
